    description: Some("A farmer guards three carrots from a gopher that burrows back and forth underground and pops up to snatch them. With a shovel you bonk it back down or fill in its holes before it surfaces; when a carrot is lost, you catch the seeds a passing duck drops to replant it. The gopher only speeds up, and the game ends once all three carrots are gone."),
